      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَبٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of 1: (Msb, TA:) [used as a
simple subst., its pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْخَابٌ</span>:] one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمِعْتُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْخَابَ الطَّيْرِ</span> <i>I heard the</i> [<i>confused</i>] <i>cries,</i> or
